        <activityName xml:lang="en">Treatment, maize starch production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 2</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Treatment, maize starch production effluent, to wastewater treatment, class 2
Wastewater purified in a moderatly large municipal wastewater treatment plant (capacity class 2), with an average capacity size of 71100 per-captia-equivalents PCE. \nWastewater contains (in kg/m3): COD: 7.34 (GSD=217%);
UUID: 884c3911-8301-434c-9929-419e006c8900
Infrastructure materials for municipal wastewater treatment plant, transports, dismantling. Land use burdens.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Three stage wastewater treatment (mechanical, biological, chemical) including sludge digestion (fermentation) according to the average technology in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_884c3911-8301-434c-9929-419e006c8900.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
